@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Password Change and Profile Update)

[*] --> PasswordChange

state PasswordChange <<choice>>
PasswordChange --> ValidateOldPassword : [Enter old password]
ValidateOldPassword --> InvalidOldPassword : [Invalid old password]

state ValidateOldPassword
ValidateOldPassword --> NewPasswordEntry : [Enter new password]
NewPasswordEntry --> PasswordMismatch : [Passwords do not match]
PasswordMismatch --> NewPasswordEntry : [Re-enter new password]

state NewPasswordEntry
NewPasswordEntry --> SaveChanges : [Validation passes]
SaveChanges --> ProfileUpdate

state ProfileUpdate <<choice>>
ProfileUpdate --> ValidateDetails : [Enter new details]
ValidateDetails --> SaveProfile : [Validation passes]

state SaveProfile
SaveProfile --> LoggedOut : [Changes saved]
LoggedOut --> [*] :
@enduml
